{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54591","headline":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"攻城寨，先料水清源（首本作「源情」、辛本、川本作「情源」，此从京本）。\n上有大流堪决灌，不须交刃损兵员，勿纵暴刚权。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}